      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not define the term \"clinical\"; it only mentions a \"clinical social worker\" and says a mental health professional can determine whether symptoms meet criteria for PTSD.",
        "\"Clinical\" is generalized here as work that judges whether symptoms fit a disorder, but the source only supports determining whether symptoms meet PTSD criteria, not a broader disorder-based definition.",
